  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut butternut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Add pumpkin, turning to coat.\n• Place sweet chilli pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Roast until tender and lightly caramelised, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the pumpkin between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-7b2c5941.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop long chilli (if using). Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine chilli, gingerlemongrass paste and a pinch of lemon zest. Set aside.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. Thinly slice pear (see ingredients) and mint leaves (reserve a few leaves for garnish!).\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-7a30355a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat sesame oil blend (see ingredients) over high heat until just smoking, 30 seconds.\n• Remove pan from heat, then carefully pour sesame oil over the ginger-lemongrass mixture in the medium bowl. Add the soy sauce, the brown sugar, a squeeze of lemon juice and some olive oil (1 tsp for 2 people / 2 tsp for 4 people) to the bowl. Mix well, then set aside to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-47809746.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-c8b4da7f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, pear, sliced mint and cooked tofu.\n• Add the dressing. Toss to coat. TIP: Allow the tofu to cool slightly before adding it to the salad to keep the leaves crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-db259e16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tofu salad between bowls. Top with sweet chilli pumpkin.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts and reserved mint leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63044b53c87d5279880d22bc/step-7fbc3919.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
